; Xbox 360 vector arguments use v1-v13 and are returned in v1. Each vector has
; a 16-byte aligned slot in the parameter area at its position in the argument
; list, but uses no GPR or FPR. The 14th and later vectors are passed in their
; slots. The parameter area starts at SP+16 and has 8-byte slots for integers,
; floats and small aggregates; aggregates larger than 8 bytes get 16-byte
; aligned slots. A callee stores aggregates and variadic GPRs to their slots.

